  "description": "This is the e-bike for all scenarios. With complete bike weight as low as 22.6kg, Amflow TL Carbon brings together 125N·m of powerful output, up to 1280Wh of capacity, and approximately 200kg total weight. And it pairs all that power with FOX full suspension, bringing agility on trails, smoothness in the city, and stability to loaded touring.\n\nAmflow TL Carbon’s lightweight build conceals all-scenario capability. At just 22.6kg, it delivers 125N·m torque, 1100W power, FOX full suspension, and up to 1280Wh capacity.\n\nFull Suspension for All-Terrain Riding\n\nA 2.9kg full-carbon frame keeps the bike exceptionally agile and durable, bringing the complete bike weight down to just 22.6kg .\n\nLong Range With 800Wh Removable Battery\n\nThe 800Wh battery is easy to swap and delivers up to 172km of range . Add a secondary battery to expand the total capacity up to 1280Wh .\n\nSupports up to 200kg Total Weight\n\nSupports up to 200kg total weight . Features MIK HD-compatible rear rack and modular mounting design for panniers and a bike trailer.\n\n125N·m Max Torque\n\nWeighing just 2.65kg, the Avinox M2 Drive Unit delivers 125N·m of max torque for steep ascents.\n\nSmarter Control for Better Rides\n\nFrom Apple® Find My tracking to Smart Heart Rate Control , every feature works together to enhance your riding experience.\n\nPremium Components and Capability\n\nSmoothShift electronic shifting delivers smooth gear changes, while suspension co-developed with FOX provides confident control.",
